+/* Single-hop TB3 discovery. Route 1 identifies host lane 1; the remote
+ * upstream lane and both PCIe adapters come from their configuration space.
+ * No device IDs, port-number tables, or write callbacks are used here.
+ * Bounds intentionally match the existing transport/inventory limits.
+ */
